# Prior Art Record – Mint-to Logic™ Ecosystem
**Date**: August 23, 2025  
**Inventor**: Spencer Southern  

## Core Concept
Mint-to Logic™ defines a governed, upgradeable AI computing ecosystem built around **Governed Smart Cells™**, which act as modular, sovereign AI engines.  

## Distinctive Elements
- Governed Smart Cells™ → atomic unit of AI governance + lifecycle control.  
- Pocket AI™ → Portable AI device, consumer-friendly.  
- Black Box™ → Stackable AI "brains," scalable for labs & enterprise.  
- Desktop AI™ → Future of home & professional computing.  
- Mint-to Logic Cybernetics™ → AI brain systems (software/neurology).  
- Mint-to Logic Robotics™ → Physical AI embodiments (bodies/machines).  

## Market Differentiation
Unlike cloud-only AI, this system:  
- Localizes intelligence into **modular hardware**.  
- Ensures **reflexive governance** via RBGA™.  
- Builds an **upgradeable marketplace** for datasets, voices, personalities, and accessories.  

